      "subject": "ישית ידו על עיניך",
      "rationale": "Literally 'will place his hand on your eyes' — the closing of a dying father's eyes; kept literal, the custom is the meaning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "גם עלה",
      "rationale": "Adverb גם plus cognate infinitive absolute of עלה ('also going-up') emphasizing certainty of the return; rendered 'anke neflaħ' to keep the echo."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Jien ninżel miegħek għal Mitsrajim, u jien niflaħek neflaħ, u Jossif jpoġġi idu fuq għajnejk.",
